** Minimal 2D contact test: rigid tool (R2D2) plunging into elastic block (CPE4R)
** Tool velocity: -1 m/s → should plunge 100μm into 200μm-tall elastic SiC block
** If contact works: block top node moves down ≥ ~90μm after 1e-4 s
*Heading
Minimal 2D rigid-deformable contact test
